      "Section": "Sync Candidate Notes",
      "Anchor": "sync-candidate-notes",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Candidate notes should be sent via the Middleware Platform whenever they are created or updated in your ATS. Use both your candidate identifier and note identifier when syncing candidate notes via API.",
